# Personal Data Strategy

Financial information is sensitive personal data.

Use this reference when issues involve:

- family contacts
- workplace contacts
- debt collection agencies
- privacy concerns
- disclosure of debt information

---

# Writing Principle

Do not accuse.

Do not conclude a violation.

Do not conclude liability.

Instead:

- note privacy concerns
- request clarification
- request data protection
- reserve complaint rights

---

# Preferred Language

"I do not consent to sharing this information with unrelated third parties."

"Please ensure personal information is handled appropriately."

"I reserve the right to pursue further complaint procedures if necessary."
